title: A file with text typed and not saved gets the Search replacement in its text, so saving writes the typed line and the replaced name together
folders: plain
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-file: plain/src/util.rs :: (?s)\A// typed first\npub fn double.*pub fn tripled\(

wait 3000
goto src/util.rs
wait 800
tool edit
edit src/util.rs 1 1
type // typed first
key enter
wait 500
search triple
wait 1500
search-option replace tripled
wait 400
search-option replace-all
wait 800
answer Replace
wait 2500
mark replaced-in-the-editor
wait 450
key save
wait 1200
quit
